      "category": "ai",
      "title": "Claudette: Make Claude stop talking like a BuzzFeed article",
      "url": "https://github.com/adnanakil/nobuzz/blob/main/README.md",
      "discuss_url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49388752",
      "score": 242,
      "comments": 172,
      "author": "aakil",
      "published": "2026-08-21T14:31:52Z",
      "bullets": [
        "Provides targeted system prompting and API wrappers to eliminate Anthropic Claude's conversational fluff, sycophancy, and sensationalist tone.",
        "Optimizes LLM token efficiency and output density by stripping unnecessary conversational preambles, disclaimers, and boilerplate text.",
        "Addresses developer friction with default model personas, streamlining Claude 3.5 Sonnet outputs for programmatic and technical workflows."
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "lobsters",
      "subsource": "lobste.rs/programming",
      "category": "engineering",
      "title": "Better Batteries",
      "url": "https://matklad.github.io/2026/08/20/better-batteries.html",
