      "bullets": [
        "Telecom misconfigurations and misdialed routing prefixes can redirect massive volumes of sensitive military PBX and VoIP traffic to unauthorized servers.",
        "Inadvertent collection of call metadata like timestamps, caller IDs, and base extensions creates severe OPSEC vulnerabilities and operational intelligence leaks.",
        "Organizations must audit SIP trunks, enforce mutual TLS, and implement anomaly detection to catch stray or hijacked telecommunications traffic."
      ]
